  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="15">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 15</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gif hwa þæt nelle, gewilde man hine to rihte mid worldlicre steore, ⁊ þæt si gemæne Criste ⁊ cyninge, ealswa hit iu wæs.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone refuses to do so, he shall be brought to justice by a civil penalty, and this shall be divided between Christ and the king, in accordance with former custom.</ab>
      </div>
